Usage: agent-deck skill <command> [options]

Manage project skills with project-level attach/detach and a global source registry.

Commands:
  list                  List discoverable skills from configured sources
  attached [id]         Show skills attached to a session/project
  attach <id> <skill>   Attach a skill to session project
  detach <id> <skill>   Detach a skill from session project
  source <cmd>          Manage global skill sources

Examples:
  agent-deck skill list
  agent-deck skill attached my-project
  agent-deck skill attach my-project web-design-guidelines
  agent-deck skill attach my-project react --source pool --restart
  agent-deck skill detach my-project web-design-guidelines
  agent-deck skill source list
  agent-deck skill source add team ~/src/team-skills
